# Requests for a locally running library-api (./mvnw -pl services/library-api spring-boot:run).
# Run them with the ▶ icon in IntelliJ, or with the REST Client extension in VS Code.
# Check the outbox_events table after each change (see README, section library-api).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1/books

### Create a book (adds a BookCreated event)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dune", "author": "Frank Herbert", "isbn": "9780441013593", "publishedYear": 1965}

### Create a second book
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Neuromancer", "author": "William Gibson", "isbn": "9780441569595", "publishedYear": 1984}

### Same ISBN again: fails, and neither a book nor an event is saved
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Copy", "author": "Someone", "isbn": "9780441013593", "publishedYear": 2000}

### All books
GET {{baseUrl}}

### One book (use an id returned above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### Unknown book: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/999

### Update a book (adds a BookUpdated event)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dune (reissue)", "author": "Frank Herbert", "isbn": "9780441013593", "publishedYear": 2015}

### Delete a book (adds a BookDeleted event)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
